## Kravtext (engelskt original)

### <span id="SP_800_171_03.09.01"></span>03.09.01 – Personnel Screening

- <span id="SR-03.09.01.a"></span> SR-03.09.01.a Screen individuals prior to authorizing access to the system.
- <span id="SR-03.09.01.b"></span> SR-03.09.01.b Rescreen individuals in accordance with [organization-defined conditions].

### <span id="SP_800_171_03.09.02"></span>03.09.02 – Personnel Termination and Transfer

- <span id="SR-03.09.02.a"></span> SR-03.09.02.a When individual employment is terminated:
  - <span id="SR-03.09.02.a.01"></span> SR-03.09.02.a.01 Disable system access within [organization-defined time period],
  - <span id="SR-03.09.02.a.02"></span> SR-03.09.02.a.02 Terminate or revoke authenticators and credentials associated with the individual, and
  - <span id="SR-03.09.02.a.03"></span> SR-03.09.02.a.03 Retrieve security-related system property.
- <span id="SR-03.09.02.b"></span> SR-03.09.02.b When individuals are reassigned or transferred to other positions in the organization:
  - <span id="SR-03.09.02.b.01"></span> SR-03.09.02.b.01 Review and confirm the ongoing operational need for current logical and physical access authorizations to the system and facility, and
  - <span id="SR-03.09.02.b.02"></span> SR-03.09.02.b.02 Modify access authorization to correspond with any changes in operational need.

